3.  to convert to base 10   (look at ex. on page 31)

    3507 base 8 = 7 + 0(8) + 5(8*8) + 3(8*8*8) = 1863 base 10

    
4.  convert to base 2 from base 10

    31 base 10 = [1 + 3(10)] base 10
               = [1 + (011)(1010)] base 2
               = [1 + (11110)] base 2
               = 11111 base 2

