DATA ACCESS CORPORATION 				      FLEX ERRORS FILE
==============================================================================

RECORD #	    ERROR DESCRIPTION			  NOTE

 ______. ________________________________________ ________________________  




________________________________________________________________________ _

			  {help available}
/SUPPORT HELP


The DATAFLEX error file is designed to allow modification of the standard
flex error messages, or the entry of new custom error messages for any
application.

The error number is the flex record number and is system assigned.  To
edit or inspect any existing error message place the cursor on the record
number window and enter the error number you would like to see.

If you would like to create your own error messages, skip over to the 
error description window and fill in your error text.  The note field
is used for your documentation to tell the user where to look for
the resolution of the error condition. 

