This screen will enable the user to input and maintain the customer file in  
the Dataflex demonstration application.  This is a standard "ENTER" screen
and as such uses the standard "flex keys".  Operations that can be performed
are: Customer record creation, deletion, editing and inspection.

The customer file is indexed on the Customer Name field and Customer Number.
On the screen the index key can be accessed by placing the cursor over the
customer window and pressing the "FIND" key.

For more help on individual fields press the help key again, otherwise press
any other key to return to the customer screen.
яяяяяя                          CUSTOMER HELP SCREEN TWO
============================================================================

CUSTOMER NUMBER: If you know the customer's number, enter it here.  To create
        new customers, press RETURN and let the system assign the customer 
        number for you.

