1. ______________ms in days.   VIA: Ship via?     SLSMN: Salesman name or initl.

CUSTOMER ORDER: The customers order or P.O. reference.

The rest of the entry portion refers to the line item section.  Within
line items you may use the up and down arrows to edit the invoice and
the delete key will delete one line item.

PART ID: You may find the part in question by part ID or description. All
the standard flex keys apply.  This is "YOUR PART ID" on the inventory
screen.

The default price will display from the inventory file, you may use or
override the price.

When done hit ESCAPE to print the invoice.
