)я␀␀␀␀␀␀
3я␀␀␀␀␀␀я␀␀␀␀␀␀#я␀␀␀␀␀␀7␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀E	␀␀␀␀␀␀я␀␀␀␀␀␀#я␀␀␀␀␀␀7␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ehen to print the invoice, update inventory
and the customer record, all on line.

The invoice creation is in two parts, header information and line items.
Both sections operate very much like an enter configuration to enhance
consistency of use.  Once both sections are completed, hit the ESCAPE key
and you will be given the oportunity to print or cancel the invoice.  The
file updates take place AFTER the invoice is printed.

INVOICE NUMBER: First you must enter the invoice number to print.

You may FIND the correct customer by either customer number or name.  If you
want to find by name, press return on customer #.  You may then find by
customer name using the standard FLEX KEY's.  You must find a valid customer 
to continue.
яяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяя                     INVOICE HELP SCREEN TWO
=========================================================================

DISC: DISCOUNT, the discount from the customer file will display here.
You may override this and enter a new discount.

