==============================================================================

This screen will enable the user to input and maintain the vendor file in the
Dataflex demonstration application.  This is a standard "ENTER" screen and as
such uses the standard "Flex keys".  Operations that can be performed are: 
Vendor record creation, deletion, editing and inspection.

The vendor file is indexed on the Vendor Name field and Vendor Number.  On the
screen the index key can be accessed by placing the cursor over the Vendor
window and pressing the "Find" key.

For more help on individual fields press the help key again, otherwise press
any other key to return to the Vendor screen.

NOTE: The user defined key will print the screen
